.SH NAME
ktm-guide-types-and-values \- Types and values (chapter 2 of the ktm language guide)
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
The built-in types, their sizes and limits, how values convert from one type to another, and how to write numbers, characters and text in source code.
.SH The built-in types
.PP
.TS
allbox tab(	);
lb lb lb
l l lx .
